    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "对于 H(s) = (24/z)*(s+z)/((s+4)(s+6))，阶跃响应为 y(t) = 1 + (12/z - 3)e^{-4t} + (2 - 12/z)e^{-6t}。当 z=4 或 z=6 时，一个模态消失（零极点对消）。最靠近原点的零点（z=1）产生最大的超调量。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "For H(s) = (24/z)*(s+z)/((s+4)(s+6)), the step response is y(t) = 1 + (12/z - 3)e^{-4t} + (2 - 12/z)e^{-6t}. When z=4 or z=6, one mode vanishes (pole-zero cancellation). The zero closest to the origin (z=1) produces the largest overshoot.",
